30 Days\' vs \'Current\'. Payment status must be reported accurately and identically across all reporting bureaus.','disputed','2026-08-14 02:57:46','2026-08-14 02:58:06'),(13,3,10,'date_opened','TransUnion','2022-03-04','Experian','2022-03-01','Equifax','2022-03-01',85,'high','The open date for SYNCB/PPC is reported inconsistently. One bureau reports 2022-03-04 while another reports 2022-03-01. This inaccurate date reporting is a clear violation of FCRA compliance.','pending','2026-08-14 03:13:41','2026-08-14 03:13:41'),(14,3,10,'credit_limit','TransUnion','$2470','Experian','$2470','Equifax','$0',70,'medium','Inconsistent credit limit reporting for SYNCB/PPC across bureaus. This variance directly impacts credit utilization and scoring formulas incorrectly.','pending','2026-08-14 03:13:41','2026-08-14 03:13:41'),(15,3,11,'date_opened','TransUnion','2019-06-05','Equifax','2019-06-01',NULL,NULL,85,'high','The open date for FEB-RETAIL is reported inconsistently. One bureau reports 2019-06-05 while another reports 2019-06-01. This inaccurate date reporting is a clear violation of FCRA compliance.','pending','2026-08-14 03:13:41','2026-08-14 03:13:41'),(16,3,11,'credit_limit','TransUnion','$3000','Equifax','$0',NULL,NULL,70,'medium','Inconsistent credit limit reporting for FEB-RETAIL across bureaus. This variance directly impacts credit utilization and scoring formulas incorrectly.','pending','2026-08-14 03:13:41','2026-08-14 03:13:41'),(17,3,11,'payment_status','TransUnion','Current','Equifax','Late 120 Days',NULL,NULL,90,'high','Highly damaging discrepancy: Payment history status for FEB-RETAIL reports \'Current\' vs \'Late 120 Days\'. Payment status must be reported accurately and identically across all reporting bureaus.','pending','2026-08-14 03:13:41','2026-08-14 03:13:41'),(18,3,12,'date_opened','TransUnion','2023-04-05','Experian','2023-04-01','Equifax','2023-04-01',85,'high','The open date for CAPITAL ONE is reported inconsistently. One bureau reports 2023-04-0